  "title": "Arteris Announces Collaboration with IC-Link by imec to Accelerate Next-Gen AI and HPC Silicon",
  "summary": "Arteris collaborates with IC-Link by imec, imec’s design and manufacturing service provider for ASICs and silicon photonics. Arteris NoC IP will be deployed as part of the ongoing effort to accelerate and simplify the development of next-generation AI and high-performance computing chiplets and application specific integrated circuits.",
